  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterOffice4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Mister\u2014 I mean\u2026 Sir Beast\u2026"
  - "You can call me Serh\xE9o. Or Andr\xE9s. Or Mr. Torres. Or Mr. Casta\xF1o. Whatever
    you like."
  - "Do you always brag about being born in a \u201Cgood country at the right time\u201D?
    Anyway, that\u2019s not what I came for! Sir Beast, I wanted to ask you something."
  - Oh? Unexpected. Go on.
  - "Well\u2026 um. I\u2019m hungry."
  - .......................
  - "Is this a joke? Because if it is, that\u2019s actually pretty funny\u2026 hahaha\u2026"
  - "No\u2026 Sir\u2014 Mister! I\u2019m serious. The next food shipment isn\u2019t
    soon, and going to the store\u2026 I\u2019m too hungry for that."
  - "So what do you want from me? Supplies? Why are you talking about shipments?
    There\u2019s plenty of food."
  - "The noodles\u2026 mashed potatoes\u2026 and cup soups are gone\u2026"
  - "Ah, so that\u2019s what it is\u2026 noodles, huh\u2026 well, if you\u2019re
    that hungry, then you\u2019ll have to ask properly! I didn\u2019t hear a single
    \u201CSir Beast\u2026 please cook something for me\u2026\u201D"
  - EXCUSE ME?!
  - "HA! That face \u2014 as always, priceless. Relax, I\u2019m joking. Want some
    barbecue?"
  - "Not surprising that with a personality like yours your \u201Cwife\u201D expects
    \u201Cfeats\u201D from you\u2026 And\u2026.yes, I want some\u2026."
  - "Let\u2019s not talk about the first part. And here\u2019s the deal \u2014 I\u2019ll
    tell you what to do, and you\u2019ll cook. Time you learned to make something
    other than instant noodles."
  - "I like noodles\u2026"
  - "but fine\u2026 Will the oil splash everywhere?"
  - "Good lord\u2026 tragic."
  - "Be careful and you won\u2019t burn yourself. You\u2019re military, aren\u2019t
    you? Hahaha\u2026"
